  "query_preview": "/Thursday through Monday/...\nIssued 248 AM MST MON NOV 2 2026\nA pair of weak upper level troughs will move through on Thursday\nand Friday, bringing a 10-30% chance of showers to northern\nareas. Temperatures will be near normal with light winds. An\nupper level ridge will build in over the weekend, with\ntemperatures warming to around 5 degrees above normal by Sunday.\nAnother upper level trough will approach the Pacific Northwest \non Monday, ushering in a 5-15% chance of showers by Monday \nnight. Temperatures will be similar on Monday with breezier \nconditions Sunday and Monday as the system approaches.",
